# Build artifacts: cargo target/ and Gradle build/.
# We DO ship the prebuilt AAR (android/play-billing-bridge.aar) so apps
# can `implementation(files(...))` it without running Gradle. The .aar
# is committed to the repo, so it slips through this ignore by virtue
# of not matching any pattern below.
target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock
**/Cargo.lock
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/local.properties

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
node_modules/
